:: MP Daily Robin 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜里的孤儿院双人卧室暖意融融，<<else>>安静的孤儿院双人卧室书桌前，<</if>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>正把一只铁皮零钱匣和一本贴着彩纸的记账簿摆在桌角，柔声问你：「这周热可可摊攒下了不少硬币，我们先把零钱按面额卷好，还是先列下周要添的棉花糖？」
<<if $mpClues["clue_robin_13_cocoa"]>><span class="teal">闻着铁罐里留存的肉桂可可甜香，你整理起摊位零钱匣时心情格外轻快。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[回罗宾身边 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回罗宾身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_robin_12 is 1>>
热可可摊的零钱卷与采买单今日已同<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>理妥，书桌整洁温馨。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去下一处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-robin-12">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "卷好摊位硬币 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-12">>
<<if (($maths or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_robin_13_cocoa'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_12 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_12_rew")>><<money 400>>硬币卷码得整整齐齐，罗宾弯起眼睛把属于你的那份摊位分成塞进你口袋。<<else>>一卷卷硬币在铁皮匣里排得密实，罗宾安心地靠在你肩头。<</if>><span class="green">你帮罗宾把整周的零钱清点得清清楚楚。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	牛皮纸卷筒松了一下，几枚便士滚到了桌沿边。<span class="red"><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>连忙伸手同你一起按住硬币。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<investigateicon>><<link "替罗宾写采买单 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-12">>
<<if (($english or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_robin_13_cocoa'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 230>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_12 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_robin_12_list"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><</if>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_12_rew_alt")>>罗宾从身后轻轻环住你的脖子，温热脸颊贴着你的耳畔轻声道谢，把一枚亲手叠的平安纸星放进你手心。<<else>>采买单字迹端正清楚，罗宾依偎在你身边小声念着甜品名字。<</if>><span class="green">罗宾毫无保留的依赖与拥抱抚平了你心底的阴霾。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">继续同行 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	钢笔尖沾了一点纸毛，写出的字迹有些发虚。<span class="red"><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>体贴地递来擦笔绒布。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Bedroom]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">握笔替罗宾写棉花糖采买单 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Robin 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
