:: MP RelDay Sera 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深后的高街钟表铺二楼工作台亮着暖黄台灯，<<else>>安静的高街钟表铺二楼工作室窗台前，<</if>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>将一枚三问报时怀表的音簧架在共鸣木座上，手边放着一把蓝钢调音镊与一碟白蜂蜡：「这枚报时表的低音锤还差一点余韵，你帮我微调音簧弧度，还是替表壳内圈封蜡？」
<<if $mpClues["clue_sera_14_musicbox"]>><span class="teal">听惯了方才八音盒滚筒校准后的清越音准，你拨动三问报时簧时一听便辨出了半音差。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[回塞拉身边 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回塞拉身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_sera_13 is 1>>
三问报时怀表的音簧今日已同<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>调校妥当，报时声清脆悠扬。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去下一处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-sera-13">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "微调音簧 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-sera-13">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_sera_14_musicbox'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_sera_13 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Sera love 1>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_sera_13_rew")>><<money 440>>低音锤敲出醇厚共鸣，塞拉欣喜地握住你的手，把钟表行会刚结的精修酬金分了一半给你。<<else>>三问报时音清越动听，塞拉眉眼弯弯地靠在你肩头听完余音。<</if>><span class="green">你精准的调音手法令塞拉赞叹不已。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	音簧弹性极强，镊尖拨动时回弹震麻了指腹。<span class="red"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>轻轻按住你的手背教你卸力。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link "密封表壳内圈 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-sera-13">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_sera_14_musicbox'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_sera_13 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_sera_13_repeater"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><<mpnpcincr Sera love 2>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 2>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_sera_13_rew_alt")>>防尘圈密封得严丝合缝，塞拉从身后温柔地拥住你，把一枚刻着你名字缩写的黄铜怀表链扣系在你衣袋上。<<else>>白蜂蜡散发出淡淡甜香，塞拉将下巴搁在你肩窝里轻声哼着歌。<</if>><span class="green">塞拉绵密温柔的依恋驱散了你心头的全部疲惫。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">继续同行 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	白蜂蜡边缘冷却略快，刮平的时候留下一道细痕。<span class="red">你将小银铲在灯罩旁温了温。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
