古林北侧的巡山界碑与风标绳今日已同<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>修整妥当。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去下一处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-ash-13">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "重系风标木桩 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-13">>
<<if (($athletics or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ash_14_brazier'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_13 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Ash love 1>><<mpnpcincr Ash trust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_13_rew")>><<money 440>>双套牛皮结纹丝不动，阿什赞许地点点头，把巡山护林队刚发的津贴银币分了一半给你。<<else>>牛皮风绳在林风中绷得笔直，阿什伸手替你摘去发间的落叶。<</if>><span class="green">你利落的绳结手艺让阿什对你刮目相看。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">离开 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	浸油牛皮绳略有些滑手，收紧第一道结时松了半寸。<span class="red"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>伸手按住绳头帮你借力。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "加深指路槽 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-13">>
<<if (($physique or 10000) + ($mpClues['clue_ash_14_brazier'] ? 600 : 0)) gte 11500 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_13 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_ash_13_cairn"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><<mpnpcincr Ash love 2>><<mpnpcincr Ash trust 2>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_13_rew_alt")>>指路槽深邃清晰，阿什解下自己的厚毛皮披风裹住你的肩膀，并把一枚刻着狼首纹的护林骨哨交给你贴身佩戴。<<else>>石槽刻痕干净利落，阿什宽厚的手掌护在你手背外一起收好刻刀。<</if>><span class="green">阿什沉默却滚烫的守护让你在深林里无所畏惧。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">继续同行 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	青石表面夹着一颗硬石英，刀尖划过时偏了一分。<span class="red">你吹去石粉换个角度下刀。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
