:: MP RelDay Ash 14 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜寒渐重的古林哨所木屋内松火融融，<<else>>干燥温暖的古林哨所木屋内铜火盆旁，<</if>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>往黄铜火盆里添入几块耐烧的白桦炭，旁边木架上挂着待烘烤的驱兽松脂饼与铁火钳：「夜里林子湿气重，你帮我用火钳把松脂饼架上烘网，还是把晒干的艾草编成防虫绳？」
<<if $mpClues["clue_ash_13_cairn"]>><span class="teal">凭着方才在北坡界碑记下的风向刻痕，你调整哨所铜火盆的排烟百叶时一拨即准。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[回阿什身边 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回阿什身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_ash_14 is 1>>
哨所木屋的驱兽松脂饼与艾草绳今日已同<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>备妥，满屋松香。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[去北坡看界碑 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去北坡看界碑 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-ash-14">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "翻动松脂饼 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-14">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ash_13_cairn'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_14 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Ash love 1>><<mpnpcincr Ash trust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_14_rew")>><<money 460>>松脂饼外干内润香气四溢，阿什满意地颔首，把替商队护送木材所得的赏银分了一半给你。<<else>>松脂暖香弥漫整间木屋，阿什递给你一碗热腾腾的野果汤。<</if>><span class="green">你火候得当的烘烤让整批驱兽松脂饼品质上佳。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	火盆里蹦出一颗火星，松脂饼边角微有融化。<span class="red">你忙用火钳把松脂饼移到外圈。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回北坡 (0:03)|MP RelDay Ash 13]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link "编防虫长绳 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-14">>
<<if (($willpower or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ash_13_cairn'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 430 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_14 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_ash_14_brazier"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><<mpnpcincr Ash love 2>><<mpnpcincr Ash trust 2>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_14_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>艾草绳编得紧实耐烧，阿什切下一小包混着白桦茸的深林干药草塞进你行囊供你防寒。<<else>>清苦回甘的艾草香萦绕指尖，阿什坐在你身侧安静地替你烘烤靴子。<</if>><span class="green">阿什把深林哨所最珍贵的药草储备与你倾囊相授。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[回营地主帐 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回营地主帐 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	干艾草茎秆略脆，拧股时断了一根细枝。<span class="red">你洒了一点温水润软草茎。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
